OL,3,CTravis Kelce speaks for first time
OL,4,Cabout 'crazy' wedding to Taylor Swift
OL,6,FNFL player Travis Kelce said his
OL,7,Fwedding to Taylor Swift was 'perfect'
OL,8,Fand 'full of celebration'
OL,10,FCredit: Kansas City Chiefs
OL,12,FTravis Kelce has spoken publicly for
OL,13,Fthe first time about his wedding to
OL,14,Fpop sensation Taylor Swift, calling it
OL,15,Fthe "best night of my life".
OL,17,FThe pair tied the knot at Madison
OL,18,FSquare Garden in New York on July 3 in
OL,19,Fa private but packed ceremony
OL,20,Fofficiated by Adam Sandler.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
