OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786621677
OL,3,CTravis Kelce speaks for first time
OL,4,Cabout 'crazy' wedding to Taylor Swift
OL,6,FDespite more than 1,000 guests
OL,7,Fattending the celebration, little has
OL,8,Fbeen revealed about the big day.
OL,10,FIt was revealed that both the bride
OL,11,Fand groom wore outfits designed by
OL,12,FChristian Dior Haute Couture, with
OL,13,Fcustom-made shoes by Christian
OL,14,FLouboutin.
OL,16,FThe couple have yet to post any
OL,17,Fpictures about their wedding online,
OL,18,Fhowever Kelce has now broken the
OL,19,Fsilence by sharing his thoughts on
OL,20,Fwhat he called the "best night of my
OL,21,Flife".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
