OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786621677
OL,3,CTravis Kelce speaks for first time
OL,4,Cabout 'crazy' wedding to Taylor Swift
OL,6,FFollowing a practice session with his
OL,7,Fteam the Kansas City Chiefs, the
OL,8,Fprofessional American footballer told
OL,9,Freporters the wedding was "perfect"
OL,10,Fand said, "I appreciate everybody who
OL,11,Fcame out and celebrated and had fun
OL,12,Fwith us."
OL,14,FKelce expressed how it had been his
OL,15,F"childhood dream" to go to Madison
OL,16,FSquare Garden and thanked the owners
OL,17,Ffor letting them use the venue.
OL,19,FHe said he had always wanted to see
OL,20,Fthe New York Knicks basketball team
OL,21,Fplay there.
OL,26,@tD@IO]wD@AOUwD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
