OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786621677
OL,3,CTravis Kelce speaks for first time
OL,4,Cabout 'crazy' wedding to Taylor Swift
OL,6,F"It's kind of cool to be able to live
OL,7,Fout my childhood dream of being in
OL,8,Fthat venue, you know the Mecca of all
OL,9,Fsports venues, being able to get
OL,10,Fmarried in there," Kelce added.
OL,12,FThe sports star described the wedding
OL,13,Fas a "crazy night" that was "full of a
OL,14,Flot of celebration".
