OL,3,CTravis Kelce speaks for first time
OL,4,Cabout 'crazy' wedding to Taylor Swift
OL,6,FGuests who attended included Selena
OL,7,FGomez, Ed Sheeran, Gigi Hadid and
OL,8,FBradley Cooper, Zoe Kravitz, Graham
OL,9,FNorton and Hugh Grant.
OL,11,FA billboard could be seen outside the
OL,12,Fvenue reading "JUST&T MARRIED" after
OL,13,Fthe ceremony took place.
OL,15,FTheir love story began in 2023 after
OL,16,FKelce publicly announced his interest
OL,17,Ffor Swift on his podcast, which she
OL,18,Flater described as a "wild, romantic
OL,19,Fgesture".
OL,26,@tD@OOUtD@^O]zD@VOU{D@HO]
