OL,3,CTravis Kelce speaks for first time
OL,4,Cabout 'crazy' wedding to Taylor Swift
OL,6,FThe pair announced their engagement in
OL,7,Fa joint Instagram post in August 2026,
OL,8,Fwhich read: "Your English teacher and
OL,9,Fyour gym teacher are getting married."
OL,11,FKelce said his favourite wedding
OL,12,Fhighlight was the air conditioning.
OL,14,F"The AC was cooking ... that was the
OL,15,Fbest part," he said.
